{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00060",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.35,
      "end_seconds": 3.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Good afternoon. Have a seat and we'll begin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 4.77,
      "end_seconds": 9.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.97,
      "end_seconds": 14.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Please do. Extra information is always welcome. Busy day out there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.66,
      "end_seconds": 18.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Right, always is. The traffic coming in was terrible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.87,
      "end_seconds": 20.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "What brings you in today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 21.01,
      "end_seconds": 25.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "It's fever and chills, doctor. She didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.36,
      "end_seconds": 28.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "How long have you had it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.96,
      "end_seconds": 36.94,
      "duration_seconds": 6.98,
      "text": "I've had it for about a week. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.4,
      "end_seconds": 39.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "How much is it bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.02,
      "end_seconds": 48.53,
      "duration_seconds": 8.51,
      "text": "It's mild, honestly. So, I've also had sharp pain on the right side when I breathe in, for ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.71,
      "end_seconds": 51.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Have you been feeling very weak?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.55,
      "end_seconds": 54.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Yeah, uh, that too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.46,
      "end_seconds": 59.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any recent travel or confusion?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.83,
      "end_seconds": 61.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "No. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.35,
      "end_seconds": 64.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "What about palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.63,
      "end_seconds": 67.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "No palpitations, thank goodness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.68,
      "end_seconds": 68.38,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Any vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.46,
      "end_seconds": 71.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 72.95,
      "end_seconds": 76.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice vomiting. She doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.93,
      "end_seconds": 87.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.26,
      "end_seconds": 93.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.76,
      "end_seconds": 97.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "So, um, no, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 98.65,
      "end_seconds": 107.3,
      "duration_seconds": 8.65,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Blood pressure 119 over 87, respiratory rate 26. Temp 37.0 degrees, oxygen saturation is 93 percent, heart rate 88."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.86,
      "end_seconds": 112.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Okay, noted. Do you need me to explain anything as we go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.92,
      "end_seconds": 120.32,
      "duration_seconds": 6.4,
      "text": "Just tell me in plain language, please. I'm not good with the medical terms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.64,
      "end_seconds": 127.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "Right, what medicines are you taking at the moment? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.34,
      "end_seconds": 132.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "I take amlodipine, 5 milligrams, once a day for my pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 133.9,
      "end_seconds": 137.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 10 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.72,
      "end_seconds": 142.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Right. Do you happen to have the current prescription here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.14,
      "end_seconds": 147.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Um, um, no, I left it at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.03,
      "end_seconds": 159.74,
      "duration_seconds": 11.71,
      "text": "I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.99,
      "end_seconds": 162.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.22,
      "end_seconds": 171.01,
      "duration_seconds": 6.79,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.39,
      "end_seconds": 184.46,
      "duration_seconds": 13.07,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for two years. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest. I've had COPD, yes. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.32,
      "end_seconds": 186.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "I see. Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.6,
      "end_seconds": 188.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "I've never smoked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.49,
      "end_seconds": 191.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Alright, do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.74,
      "end_seconds": 196.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "I have a couple of drinks on the weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.22,
      "end_seconds": 200.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.28,
      "end_seconds": 209.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Latex. I come out in... well, a rash on my hands."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.72,
      "end_seconds": 214.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.42,
      "end_seconds": 218.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Right, now bend it for me, slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.72,
      "end_seconds": 241.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "There's bronchial breathing and crackles at the right lower zone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.67,
      "end_seconds": 244.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "I'll just listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.74,
      "end_seconds": 260.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Breathing rate is a bit fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.7,
      "end_seconds": 291.13,
      "duration_seconds": 25.43,
      "text": "Okay, all done, thank you, please sit down. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. Putting it all together, I think we're dealing with a possible pneumonia on the right side at this stage. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. A pulmonary embolism is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.83,
      "end_seconds": 295.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.47,
      "end_seconds": 313.22,
      "duration_seconds": 15.75,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a possible pneumonia on the right side do well once it's treated properly. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had fever and chills for about a week, mild, and no confusion or recent travel."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.0,
      "end_seconds": 315.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.89,
      "end_seconds": 319.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 319.89,
      "end_seconds": 326.35,
      "duration_seconds": 6.46,
      "text": "Okay, so busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.93,
      "end_seconds": 355.36,
      "duration_seconds": 27.43,
      "text": "Let's get a sputum culture, for pneumonia. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. I'm going to order blood tests, for infection. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. I'm prescribing levofloxacin, 500 milligrams, once a day, for five days. You take it by mouth. That's for chest infection. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 355.68,
      "end_seconds": 357.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Right, I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.29,
      "end_seconds": 374.45,
      "duration_seconds": 16.16,
      "text": "Rest and fluids, and finish every dose of the antibiotic. Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 374.76,
      "end_seconds": 376.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 376.85,
      "end_seconds": 385.3,
      "duration_seconds": 8.45,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the breathlessness worsens or you become drowsy, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 387.95,
      "end_seconds": 389.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.7,
      "end_seconds": 392.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Come back in three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 393.27,
      "end_seconds": 397.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "Oh, sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 398.49,
      "end_seconds": 404.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.98,
      "text": "Alright, I want to be sure we're on the same page. How would you describe the plan?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 408.29,
      "end_seconds": 415.45,
      "duration_seconds": 7.16,
      "text": "So, I take the levofloxacin, 500 milligrams, once a day and come back in three days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 416.34,
      "end_seconds": 421.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. We're all set. Don't leave without asking if something's unclear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 422.39,
      "end_seconds": 425.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "That's everything I wanted to ask. Thank you."
    }
  ]
}